{"id":"ae73517b37afdb1d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FUsesProof.md","title":"FUsesProof","display":"FUsesProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FUsesProof","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","x","t","z2281"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FUsesProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>x</span><span>t</span><span>z2281</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>z2281</code>。</p>\n<p>一阶公式中的所有变量名字，包括量词声明；用于保守的新鲜性选择。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FUsesProof E F R f r x t z2281)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z2284\n  (exists z2285\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z2281 z2284)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z2281 z2285)\n        (and\n          (@ Pair x t z2285)\n          (forall z2282\n            (implies\n              (in z2282 z2284)\n              (exists z2283 (and (@ App z2281 z2282 z2283) (@ FUsesRow E F R f r z2281 z2282 z2283))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3d8db0438534f9d8\" href=\"?note=3d8db0438534f9d8\" title=\"ZFC_FUsesRow\">FUsesRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FUsesProof E F R f r x t z2281)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FUsesRow|FUsesRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FUsesRow","status":"resolved","id":"3d8db0438534f9d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FUsesRow|FUsesRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Last","status":"resolved","id":"d72dedf3d7200b4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FUsesRow|FUsesRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FUsesRow|FUsesRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Seq","st